   `vendor/qpp-upstream/qpp/` and an upstream-compatible unified patch at
   `patches/qpp-vss-warden.patch` targeting BlackBerry Limited's QNX 8.0
   POSIX Publish Subscribe (`QPP`) Resource Manager (`qpp/value.c`,
   `qpp/metadata.c`, `qpp/catalog.c`, `qpp/ioopen.c`, `qpp/iowrite.c`,
   `qpp/iowrite_text.c`, and `qpp/ioclose.c`), as well as automotive
   signal presets derived from COVESA Vehicle Signal Specification (VSS v3)
   `signal_catalog.json`.
